WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:52.241
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:52.511 --> 00:53.387
ALL PERSONS, LOCATIONS, RELIGIONS, INCIDENTS, AND ORGANIZATIONS IN THIS DRAMA

3
00:53.512 --> 00:54.346
ARE FICTITIOUS

4
00:54.472 --> 00:55.306
CHILD ACTORS HAVE FILMED SAFELY UNDER PARENTAL SUPERVISION

5
00:55.431 --> 00:56.265
SCENES INVOLVING ANIMALS WERE FILMED SAFELY WITH EXPERT ADVICE AND COOPERATION

6
00:57.183 --> 01:00.436
I just found it stuck between the seats.

7
01:02.062 --> 01:05.733
So the last place she got off at was Seocho Sejong Tower?

8
01:05.858 --> 01:09.653
That's right. I think it was a little past 10:00.

9
01:09.779 --> 01:12.531
The lady was so drunk, so I remember it clearly.

10
01:14.158 --> 01:14.992
Okay, thank you.

11
01:15.117 --> 01:16.535
FRIENDLY RIDES MEMORABLE EXITS

12
01:26.796 --> 01:30.049
25TH: CAN YOU SEND AN EXTRA MILLION WON JUST THIS MONTH?

13
01:35.262 --> 01:37.723
Did you unlock it? Who was the last caller?

14
01:38.599 --> 01:39.517
I did.

15
01:41.519 --> 01:43.813
NAMGUNG-TUSH

16
01:43.938 --> 01:45.022
TIN CAN BASTARD

17
01:46.857 --> 01:47.691
You're awake.

18
01:49.860 --> 01:50.820
What?

19
01:51.654 --> 01:52.947
Why am I here?

20
01:54.240 --> 01:55.574
Answer the phone first.

21
01:57.952 --> 01:59.954
I think it's your boyfriend.

22
02:03.999 --> 02:05.042
DIRECTOR LEE MI-DO

23
02:06.001 --> 02:07.044
I guessed right.

24
02:09.839 --> 02:11.340
It is your boyfriend.

25
02:19.723 --> 02:20.558
What now?

26
02:21.100 --> 02:22.434
If you want, I can decline--

27
02:26.063 --> 02:26.939
Hey, Namgung.

28
02:27.064 --> 02:28.482
Where are you?

29
02:28.607 --> 02:30.734
I'll go home. We'll talk there.

30
02:30.860 --> 02:32.903
-Where are you? I'll pick you up. -Is it her?

31
02:33.028 --> 02:34.947
-Where is she? Who is she with? -Hold on.

32
02:35.072 --> 02:37.992
I'll explain at home. I'll be there in 30 minutes.

33
02:39.326 --> 02:40.578
Hello? Mi-do--

34
02:46.333 --> 02:47.334
She's coming home.

35
02:55.050 --> 02:57.011
Explain what happened.

36
02:58.762 --> 02:59.930
You don't remember?

37
03:00.848 --> 03:02.391
Wow.

38
03:02.516 --> 03:04.435
I guess you really don't remember.

39
03:10.232 --> 03:11.525
Still nothing?

40
03:15.571 --> 03:18.157
Are you going to meet with Mr. Seo and self-destruct?

41
03:19.450 --> 03:20.993
Ugh, seriously.

42
03:21.118 --> 03:23.370
What are you going to do there?

43
03:32.504 --> 03:33.547
Director Lee.

44
03:35.591 --> 03:36.425
Wait.

45
03:45.309 --> 03:47.645
VACANT

46
03:55.444 --> 03:56.862
Damn it.

47
04:30.813 --> 04:32.523
ELEVATOR UNDER MAINTENANCE

48
04:32.648 --> 04:33.691
Please check.

49
04:34.441 --> 04:36.151
Repairs are complete.

50
04:36.276 --> 04:37.319
Understood.

51
04:52.167 --> 04:53.836
I'm very lucky.

52
04:54.962 --> 04:56.171
What are the odds

53
04:57.214 --> 04:59.425
of the elevator breaking down right at that moment?

54
05:00.300 --> 05:02.302
For the record, I didn't do it.

55
05:02.428 --> 05:05.556
Even I couldn't have predicted a variable like that.

56
05:23.449 --> 05:24.658
DIRECTOR LEE MI-DO SEND FILE

57
05:25.200 --> 05:26.827
What are you doing?

58
05:26.952 --> 05:29.121
Securing evidence for a false accusation claim.

59
05:31.540 --> 05:33.709
I'll send the settlement agreement by courier today.

60
05:35.753 --> 05:37.963
Congratulations. You won.

61
05:44.511 --> 05:47.181
There are no hallway cameras on this floor.

62
05:50.684 --> 05:52.478
Take the stairs, not the elevator.

63
05:53.479 --> 05:56.148
And avoid the lobby. Go to the third basement level.

64
05:56.690 --> 05:58.442
There's an elevator to the next building.

65
05:58.567 --> 05:59.693
Why?

66
06:00.527 --> 06:03.280
Because Seo Ju-hyeok can't find out that I was here?

67
06:04.865 --> 06:05.699
Fine.

68
06:05.824 --> 06:08.368
I'll take the stairs to the third basement level.

69
06:13.207 --> 06:14.625
When you send the settlement,

70
06:14.750 --> 06:15.918
have an expert provide proof

71
06:16.043 --> 06:18.796
that the files were deleted from your cloud and hard drives.

72
06:18.921 --> 06:21.131
I will. Get out of my way.

73
06:22.716 --> 06:23.842
Hey!

74
06:23.967 --> 06:25.427
What?

75
06:25.552 --> 06:28.222
What else is there? Just say it!

76
06:31.183 --> 06:32.309
Once you leave,

77
06:35.604 --> 06:37.523
will we never see each other again?

78
07:10.848 --> 07:16.728
5. ARE THERE ANY UNTOLD STORIES BETWEEN US?

79
07:16.854 --> 07:19.439
Look, this is the office,

80
07:19.565 --> 07:21.441
and this is the sofa I slept on.

81
07:23.277 --> 07:25.529
And he just sat there and did work.

82
07:26.572 --> 07:29.116
I swear. Absolutely nothing happened.

83
07:32.452 --> 07:33.829
I'm sorry I worried you.

84
07:33.954 --> 07:37.166
I was so stressed about the settlement agreement.

85
07:37.291 --> 07:39.376
I was drunk and wasn't thinking.

86
07:43.922 --> 07:45.799
I think he tried to trick me

87
07:45.924 --> 07:48.552
into signing the settlement while I was drunk.

88
07:49.428 --> 07:50.262
What?

89
07:50.387 --> 07:52.181
You know that lawyer?

90
07:52.306 --> 07:54.516
That bastard is like a tin can.

91
07:54.641 --> 07:56.727
Trash that'll take at least 200 years to rot.

92
07:56.852 --> 07:58.353
What do you mean? Be clear.

93
07:58.478 --> 08:01.148
But technically, I did start it.

94
08:02.274 --> 08:04.443
I found out his weakness by accident

95
08:04.568 --> 08:07.487
and blackmailed him to change the contract in my favor.

96
08:12.409 --> 08:13.577
Of course,

97
08:14.828 --> 08:16.288
I really regret it now.

98
08:17.122 --> 08:19.374
I'm really reflecting on what I did.

99
08:21.919 --> 08:22.878
Hey!

100
08:26.965 --> 08:27.966
Give me his number.

101
08:29.259 --> 08:30.093
Hey.

102
08:30.219 --> 08:31.595
Should I ask Oh Yeon-ju?

103
08:32.554 --> 08:34.556
I'm telling you, nothing happened.

104
08:34.681 --> 08:36.475
After sending the settlement today,

105
08:36.600 --> 08:38.101
I'll never have to see him again.

106
08:38.227 --> 08:40.187
So you expect me to let it go?

107
08:40.312 --> 08:41.647
Then what should I do?

108
08:42.314 --> 08:45.234
Walk into the law firm holding your hand like a preschooler?

109
08:45.359 --> 08:47.444
That's what you say after making me worry?

110
08:47.569 --> 08:49.655
I'm acting like this because I'm sorry.

111
08:49.780 --> 08:51.365
The guilt is killing me.

112
08:51.490 --> 08:52.866
You don't even look sorry.

113
08:52.991 --> 08:54.701
Then what should I do? Huh?

114
08:54.826 --> 08:55.994
Should I just cry?

115
08:56.119 --> 08:58.038
Yes, cry! Go on!

116
08:58.997 --> 09:00.624
Ugh, seriously.

117
09:01.166 --> 09:02.459
Damn it.

118
09:21.853 --> 09:24.106
I'm sorry for worrying you, sweetie.

119
09:25.065 --> 09:27.067
But as you saw in the video earlier,

120
09:27.192 --> 09:29.403
nothing really happened, sweetie.

121
09:29.528 --> 09:31.822
I know. That's not the point, sweetie.

122
09:31.947 --> 09:33.615
Don't force yourself to settle, sweetie.

123
09:33.740 --> 09:36.702
No, I also just wanted to end it here, sweetie.

124
09:36.827 --> 09:39.037
I guess it's for the best, sweetie.

125
09:39.162 --> 09:40.205
Just like that, sweetie?

126
09:40.747 --> 09:42.916
Why? We'll go to trial if you want, sweetie.

127
09:43.041 --> 09:44.418
Oh no, sweetie.

128
09:44.543 --> 09:46.795
I could be writing instead, sweetie.

129
09:47.796 --> 09:51.049
Alcohol is what caused all of this, sweetie.

130
09:51.174 --> 09:52.259
I'm taking

131
09:53.051 --> 09:55.095
a three-month break from drinking, sweetie.

132
09:55.887 --> 09:57.264
Only three months, sweetie?

133
09:57.389 --> 09:59.725
It's not just any three months, sweetie.

134
09:59.850 --> 10:01.768
It includes Christmas, the end of the year,

135
10:01.893 --> 10:03.103
and the New Year, sweetie.

136
10:03.228 --> 10:05.939
I'm saying I'll give all that up, sweetie.

137
10:06.064 --> 10:08.108
Oh, that's huge for sure, sweetie.

138
10:09.860 --> 10:11.361
I said I'm sorry, sweetie.

139
10:20.954 --> 10:22.914
-Stop, I get it. -I'm trying here.

140
10:35.761 --> 10:36.636
Namgung.

141
10:37.679 --> 10:39.264
Did you wait long yesterday?

142
10:42.934 --> 10:43.769
No.

143
10:44.728 --> 10:45.562
Sorry.

144
10:46.813 --> 10:50.359
Let's meet on the second snowfall this year instead of the first.

145
10:50.484 --> 10:51.860
I'll be waiting for you.

146
10:57.366 --> 10:58.408
Mi-do.

147
11:01.328 --> 11:02.704
I was wondering.

148
11:06.041 --> 11:06.917
Have you…

149
11:07.334 --> 11:10.837
25TH: CAN YOU SEND AN EXTRA MILLION WON JUST THIS MONTH?

150
11:17.511 --> 11:20.013
Never mind. Let's talk after work.

151
11:28.522 --> 11:30.107
Bambi!

152
11:30.816 --> 11:31.650
Bambi.

153
11:31.775 --> 11:34.152
Where did she go?

154
11:34.277 --> 11:35.112
Bambi!

155
11:36.696 --> 11:37.823
Hey, move.

156
11:41.368 --> 11:42.202
Okay.

157
11:42.327 --> 11:43.995
LOVE EAT

158
11:46.581 --> 11:47.916
Come on.

159
12:05.267 --> 12:07.227
City Hall raided us recently,

160
12:08.019 --> 12:09.729
so she's gotten more cautious.

161
12:10.814 --> 12:13.066
Oh, no wonder.

162
12:14.609 --> 12:16.820
By the way, how do you know Bambi?

163
12:16.945 --> 12:19.197
It's not Bambi. It's Pudgy.

164
12:20.615 --> 12:23.034
Plenty of people feed her besides us.

165
12:23.160 --> 12:25.412
Look how chubby she is.

166
12:28.290 --> 12:30.750
Did you know I was feeding Bambi?

167
12:31.543 --> 12:34.588
I said it's not Bambi. It's Pudgy.

168
12:35.255 --> 12:36.173
Pudgy?

169
12:36.298 --> 12:37.883
Such tragic naming skills.

170
12:40.886 --> 12:42.929
The mom wasn't caught, right?

171
12:43.847 --> 12:44.848
Oh, she ran away.

172
12:46.558 --> 12:47.434
I saw her.

173
12:48.310 --> 12:49.352
She hasn't returned.

174
12:50.020 --> 12:51.229
She's not very motherly.

175
12:54.483 --> 12:55.692
By the way,

176
12:55.817 --> 12:58.862
why did you go to the Cheonan factory this morning?

177
12:59.529 --> 13:00.780
That wasn't in the schedule.

178
13:01.615 --> 13:04.034
I went to explain the new seasoning mix.

179
13:05.160 --> 13:08.288
It's not what you think, so don't get ahead of yourself.

180
13:10.999 --> 13:13.627
Why don't you take another shot at becoming a reporter?

181
13:13.752 --> 13:15.045
That was your dream.

182
13:16.713 --> 13:18.298
You clearly got rejected,

183
13:18.423 --> 13:20.926
and now you're trying to fulfill your potential here.

184
13:21.551 --> 13:23.386
Give it another try. You're still young.

185
13:24.304 --> 13:25.972
I never even applied.

186
13:26.097 --> 13:28.391
So I never got rejected.

187
13:29.059 --> 13:31.269
I specifically aimed for Hunmin Confectionery,

188
13:31.394 --> 13:35.524
and I was capable enough to get hired that same year.

189
13:36.483 --> 13:38.693
Wasn't your dream to be a reporter?

190
13:40.111 --> 13:42.364
Well, briefly in high school.

191
13:42.989 --> 13:44.115
Just for a while.

192
13:45.200 --> 13:47.619
Come on. You wanted to be Korea's Amanpour

193
13:47.744 --> 13:50.539
and recited "A Night Counting Stars" all day in the pavilion.

194
13:50.664 --> 13:52.541
I memorized that whole poem because of you.

195
13:53.166 --> 13:55.835
When did I ever do that? I did no such thing.

196
13:56.670 --> 13:57.504
Let's go in.

197
14:01.633 --> 14:03.510
How are you holding up? How's the injury?

198
14:04.553 --> 14:06.596
Oh, I'm fine.

199
14:07.472 --> 14:08.557
Jeez.

200
14:09.432 --> 14:10.767
Get it checked out.

201
14:12.561 --> 14:13.395
Okay.

202
14:16.398 --> 14:18.858
Back off. We're near work. People will talk.

203
14:18.984 --> 14:20.485
-Hurry. -Oh, right.

204
14:21.361 --> 14:22.237
Three steps.

205
14:22.362 --> 14:23.446
Three steps?

206
14:24.364 --> 14:26.241
-More, more. -More?

207
14:26.950 --> 14:28.034
That's good.

208
14:38.878 --> 14:41.923
Gosh, seriously. I play along, and you cross the line.

209
14:47.345 --> 14:49.180
Damn it, seriously.

210
14:53.393 --> 14:55.562
KO MUN-YEONG LAB

211
15:04.529 --> 15:05.697
I only have eight minutes.

212
15:05.822 --> 15:07.282
So don't argue. Just listen.

213
15:07.407 --> 15:09.451
Are you kidding me?

214
15:09.576 --> 15:10.827
Then text me. I'm busy too.

215
15:10.952 --> 15:13.788
I'll cut this month's principal and interest by 10%.

216
15:14.414 --> 15:15.957
Go on. Tell me.

217
15:28.553 --> 15:29.596
Thank you.

218
15:35.060 --> 15:36.478
So…

219
15:37.062 --> 15:39.481
Use contraception properly!

220
15:39.606 --> 15:40.523
KO MUN-YEONG CHALLENGE

221
15:40.649 --> 15:42.317
-Use your socials… -Properly!

222
15:42.442 --> 15:44.110
-Properly! -Properly!

223
15:44.235 --> 15:45.612
Properly-ly-ly!

224
15:45.737 --> 15:46.780
Don't do anything…

225
15:46.905 --> 15:47.947
…you'll regret!

226
15:48.073 --> 15:50.575
…you'll regret-ret-ret!

227
15:52.661 --> 15:54.412
How are you handling the kid?

228
15:54.537 --> 15:57.707
It would've hit the news if PR hadn't found it so fast.

229
15:57.832 --> 16:00.502
Then why did you do something you would regret?

230
16:01.086 --> 16:03.463
It's trending again. The Ko Mun-yeong drunk challenge.

231
16:03.588 --> 16:06.841
When Sang-su got counseling for this last time,

232
16:06.966 --> 16:10.178
I thought he and I worked it out, but I guess not.

233
16:11.012 --> 16:12.764
He should go back to counseling.

234
16:14.265 --> 16:17.602
Come on, he was just having fun. You're overreacting again.

235
16:18.311 --> 16:19.145
Overreacting?

236
16:20.397 --> 16:21.439
Yes, overreacting.

237
16:22.273 --> 16:23.692
Don't you know Sang-su?

238
16:24.359 --> 16:25.985
He doesn't think much of it.

239
16:26.111 --> 16:28.655
It's just a fun trend.

240
16:28.780 --> 16:30.990
His friends do it, so he just joined in.

241
16:31.116 --> 16:35.120
3:00 p.m. on the 3rd, 7:00 on the 9th, or 11:00 on the 11th.

242
16:35.245 --> 16:36.329
Pick a time.

243
16:36.454 --> 16:38.748
I'm scheduling a parent-child session.

244
16:38.873 --> 16:40.458
Come on, that's overkill.

245
16:40.583 --> 16:42.961
Stop reading so much into nothing.

246
16:47.924 --> 16:49.175
You haven't changed.

247
16:50.468 --> 16:52.554
You got divorced over "nothing,"

248
16:52.679 --> 16:56.599
and you still treat everything like it's no big deal.

249
16:59.060 --> 17:00.687
Ever been slapped with a burger?

250
17:02.188 --> 17:04.524
In a place full of middle schoolers?

251
17:05.567 --> 17:07.318
Ever been slapped like that?

252
17:09.070 --> 17:10.113
I want a burger.

253
17:10.238 --> 17:12.866
I haven't been able to eat a burger since then.

254
17:12.991 --> 17:13.992
I'm traumatized.

255
17:14.117 --> 17:15.952
Is this about Sang-su doing that challenge?

256
17:16.661 --> 17:17.871
Should I talk to him?

257
17:17.996 --> 17:20.248
We were coming back from a nice trip

258
17:20.373 --> 17:22.792
and didn't want to cook at home.

259
17:23.460 --> 17:27.213
We decided to grab burgers on the way, so we went in.

260
17:27.338 --> 17:29.424
But just because I didn't grab enough ketchup…

261
17:30.258 --> 17:33.094
she threw a burger at me and asked for a divorce.

262
17:33.219 --> 17:35.346
You said things were rocky on the trip.

263
17:35.472 --> 17:37.223
It's not that I'm not over her.

264
17:37.348 --> 17:38.767
I'm just genuinely curious.

265
17:38.892 --> 17:42.395
She didn't leave me even when I failed the civil service exam.

266
17:42.520 --> 17:43.688
Right.

267
17:45.064 --> 17:48.568
When you blew the store deposit trading overseas stocks,

268
17:48.693 --> 17:50.737
she let it slide without a word.

269
17:50.862 --> 17:53.406
No, there was definitely another reason.

270
17:54.282 --> 17:55.366
I'm sure of it.

271
17:56.826 --> 17:58.036
Do you really not know?

272
18:03.708 --> 18:05.335
How would I know if you don't?

273
18:07.796 --> 18:09.088
Try calling my baby.

274
18:09.214 --> 18:11.883
His stomachaches seem to linger this time of year.

275
18:12.634 --> 18:13.927
Your baby's 30 this year.

276
18:14.052 --> 18:15.094
You call him.

277
18:16.721 --> 18:19.808
-What are you doing? -Being clingy.

278
18:23.770 --> 18:24.687
Hold on.

279
18:25.730 --> 18:27.023
Stop sending gift cards.

280
18:27.148 --> 18:27.982
Adult movies…

281
18:29.317 --> 18:30.819
I don't know anything about them.

282
18:30.944 --> 18:33.696
24 Hours Is Never Enough, 365 Days Isn't Enough,

283
18:33.822 --> 18:34.656
Secrets of Hiking,

284
18:34.781 --> 18:36.157
In-Laws Are Fine.

285
18:36.282 --> 18:38.201
Do you know any others besides these?

286
18:38.326 --> 18:39.744
I don't.

287
18:39.869 --> 18:43.206
Without knowing her pay, how would I know how many film contracts she signed?

288
18:44.791 --> 18:45.625
Hey!

289
18:46.209 --> 18:47.502
You didn't, did you?

290
18:47.627 --> 18:49.045
Dude, if Mi-do finds out

291
18:49.170 --> 18:51.714
that I told you about the studio, I'm dead.

292
18:52.382 --> 18:54.050
Hey! Namgung!

293
18:54.175 --> 18:55.009
Nam--

294
19:01.391 --> 19:03.852
Director Lee, did you see the posting from Danwol City?

295
19:04.519 --> 19:06.813
You know your script, My Dear Dictator?

296
19:07.480 --> 19:08.982
You should submit it.

297
19:09.107 --> 19:10.859
Danwol City's orchestra is quite famous,

298
19:10.984 --> 19:12.986
so it's a perfect fit for your work.

299
19:13.111 --> 19:14.654
Oh, that's a great idea.

300
19:14.779 --> 19:17.574
You should submit it. Have you revised it at all?

301
19:20.577 --> 19:22.287
You guys must not be busy.

302
19:22.412 --> 19:24.497
Is pre-production too easy for you?

303
19:24.622 --> 19:27.458
Or did Director Gong get more flexible with age?

304
19:27.584 --> 19:29.794
Filming starts late next year,

305
19:29.919 --> 19:31.337
so we have some time.

306
19:32.046 --> 19:34.173
Anyway, I looked at the posting,

307
19:34.299 --> 19:36.050
and the requirements are practically…

308
19:37.635 --> 19:39.971
ATTACK ON THE WALKING TRIPOD

309
19:53.067 --> 19:54.235
Yes, Namgung.

310
19:54.360 --> 19:57.655
She must have signed with another studio. What do we do?

311
19:57.780 --> 20:02.785
You worked so hard with that studio to get her contract canceled.

312
20:04.412 --> 20:05.496
I pitched Danwol City.

313
20:05.622 --> 20:08.124
I keep telling her to do indie films,

314
20:08.249 --> 20:09.250
but it's not easy.

315
20:10.126 --> 20:11.920
Once I find out the new studio,

316
20:12.045 --> 20:14.047
I'll let you know right away…

317
20:20.511 --> 20:22.972
Namgung, what do I do?

318
20:23.097 --> 20:25.141
Director Lee is right here.

319
20:26.100 --> 20:27.685
Okay, you've got my back--

320
20:27.810 --> 20:30.229
Hello? Namgung? Namgung!

321
20:31.272 --> 20:33.900
Since when did Namgung Ho become your boss?

322
20:36.069 --> 20:39.781
When we met at the police station,

323
20:39.906 --> 20:43.409
he gave me money for a taxi,

324
20:43.534 --> 20:46.120
and I gave him my number.

325
20:46.245 --> 20:48.373
That's how we connected…

326
21:01.844 --> 21:04.514
Did you pay the studio to cancel my contract?

327
21:05.974 --> 21:07.225
Yeah.

328
21:07.350 --> 21:10.353
I paid 10% more than your advance to cancel it.

329
21:11.854 --> 21:13.356
But it was all for nothing,

330
21:13.481 --> 21:16.359
because you went and signed another contract.

331
21:16.484 --> 21:18.695
I know you hate me shooting adult films.

332
21:19.612 --> 21:22.532
Sorry I didn't tell you about the remaining contract.

333
21:22.657 --> 21:23.825
But Namgung,

334
21:25.076 --> 21:26.369
this isn't right.

335
21:27.161 --> 21:28.705
You crossed the line.

336
21:29.497 --> 21:30.540
For how long?

337
21:32.458 --> 21:34.794
-What? -How long…

338
21:37.463 --> 21:38.715
have you been paying her?

339
21:40.133 --> 21:42.260
It's been two years, as far as I know.

340
21:42.927 --> 21:45.430
Because that's when you started directing adult films.

341
21:48.141 --> 21:50.101
Why didn't you tell me?

342
21:51.060 --> 21:52.895
Why didn't you tell me and just…

343
21:58.067 --> 21:59.819
I'm not mad at you.

344
22:01.404 --> 22:03.281
She must have used me to threaten you.

345
22:03.406 --> 22:06.117
Saying she'd come find me if you didn't pay her.

346
22:06.868 --> 22:07.994
It's so obvious

347
22:08.828 --> 22:10.747
what that woman must have done to you.

348
22:12.165 --> 22:13.750
I did pay her living expenses.

349
22:14.876 --> 22:17.879
But it has nothing to do with Hwa-young.

350
22:18.004 --> 22:19.756
Send me the total by next week.

351
22:20.590 --> 22:21.632
I'll pay you back.

352
22:21.758 --> 22:22.633
Hey.

353
22:24.010 --> 22:25.511
Why would you pay me?

354
22:25.636 --> 22:27.597
I didn't do it expecting you to pay me.

355
22:27.722 --> 22:28.598
Take it.

356
22:31.142 --> 22:32.935
Or I won't be able to look at you.

357
22:41.194 --> 22:44.072
Why would you ruin your career because of me?

358
22:45.448 --> 22:49.827
I know better than anyone how much films mean to you.

359
22:53.539 --> 22:55.374
Why should you have to do that?

360
23:00.797 --> 23:01.881
Namgung.

361
23:07.345 --> 23:08.471
Don't be ridiculous.

362
23:09.138 --> 23:13.518
My pride as a director hasn't been ruined just because I directed a few adult films.

363
23:14.769 --> 23:15.603
Hey.

364
23:16.312 --> 23:17.772
I'm Lee Mi-do.

365
23:18.981 --> 23:21.400
I don't let things like that sway me.

366
23:22.068 --> 23:22.902
Okay?

367
23:25.196 --> 23:27.281
I'm too ashamed to look at you.

368
23:32.662 --> 23:35.414
I could go crazy from how sorry and embarrassed I am.

369
23:35.540 --> 23:37.375
What's so embarrassing about this?

370
23:38.376 --> 23:40.294
What's really embarrassing is

371
23:41.003 --> 23:44.674
ten-year-old you going to camp and peeing his pants after seeing a bat.

372
23:44.799 --> 23:45.633
Hey!

373
23:46.175 --> 23:47.009
Jeez.

374
23:49.804 --> 23:50.721
Namgung.

375
23:51.764 --> 23:53.432
Even if I went back in time,

376
23:55.268 --> 23:56.978
I'd still make the same choice.

377
23:59.438 --> 24:00.815
I don't regret it.

378
24:04.026 --> 24:05.153
I'm sorry.

379
24:06.654 --> 24:08.406
I didn't even know.

380
24:10.366 --> 24:11.784
I said awful things to you,

381
24:12.702 --> 24:13.870
hurt you,

382
24:14.829 --> 24:15.872
and lashed out.

383
24:19.000 --> 24:19.917
I'm sorry.

384
24:22.253 --> 24:24.380
You are?

385
24:28.259 --> 24:29.927
If you're that sorry…

386
24:31.095 --> 24:32.763
you're doing the recycling for a month.

387
24:33.848 --> 24:35.308
I already do that.

388
24:35.433 --> 24:37.685
Hmm, then dishes for a month.

389
24:38.394 --> 24:39.812
I already do that too.

390
24:39.937 --> 24:42.064
Then let's call it even.

391
24:46.819 --> 24:47.987
Listen.

392
24:48.112 --> 24:51.824
Don't you dare use this as an excuse to go see Hwa-young.

393
24:51.949 --> 24:52.783
Got it?

394
24:57.872 --> 24:58.706
You didn't, right?

395
24:58.831 --> 25:00.666
I hired a lawyer.

396
25:02.668 --> 25:05.129
I'm going to do everything I legally can.

397
25:06.505 --> 25:07.798
I'm ending this for good.

398
25:09.217 --> 25:12.845
So I think I need to see her one last time.

399
25:15.431 --> 25:17.308
Just let me do this once.

400
25:22.813 --> 25:23.898
I'll go with you.

401
25:26.859 --> 25:29.654
I don't want you to see me with that woman.

402
25:35.326 --> 25:36.244
Mi-do.

403
25:38.329 --> 25:40.498
I'll really end it this time.

404
25:43.834 --> 25:44.961
Just wait for me.

405
25:50.967 --> 25:51.801
Okay.

406
25:59.850 --> 26:01.018
Oh, wait a second.

407
26:04.021 --> 26:04.897
Here.

408
26:07.358 --> 26:08.234
What's this?

409
26:09.068 --> 26:10.278
A voice recorder.

410
26:10.403 --> 26:13.906
Turn it on when you see her, just in case.

411
26:14.031 --> 26:16.200
For the record, this isn't illegal.

412
26:18.327 --> 26:19.203
Namgung.

413
26:20.621 --> 26:22.456
Only say half.

414
26:26.669 --> 26:30.423
Only say half of what you want to say to Hwa-young.

415
26:33.217 --> 26:35.928
Pouring everything out might feel good in the moment,

416
26:36.595 --> 26:38.180
but you'll hurt more later.

417
26:42.059 --> 26:43.644
My Mi-do has grown up.

418
26:44.270 --> 26:46.063
Someone raised me well.

419
26:56.282 --> 26:59.285
I won't leave you to suffer alone anymore.

420
27:02.413 --> 27:03.956
I'll protect you.

421
27:20.806 --> 27:22.641
When revising a script,

422
27:22.767 --> 27:26.354
some scenes inevitably get deleted for the sake of pacing and length.

423
27:26.479 --> 27:28.230
MY DEAR DICTATOR VER. 12

424
27:28.898 --> 27:30.566
The so-called deleted scenes.

425
27:31.609 --> 27:35.196
Even without these scenes, the story still flows and connects well.

426
27:35.905 --> 27:38.407
They are unknown only to the audience.

427
27:38.532 --> 27:41.994
Our lives are also made up by deleted scenes such as these.

428
27:42.119 --> 27:44.246
The ones we want to hide from others.

429
27:44.372 --> 27:45.456
DELETED SCENES

430
27:45.581 --> 27:47.625
The untold stories only I know about.

431
28:04.183 --> 28:05.184
Hey, Namgung.

432
28:05.309 --> 28:08.104
It's cold. You bundled up, right?

433
28:08.229 --> 28:10.856
He's sick in bed. Why would he dress up?

434
28:10.981 --> 28:13.401
Hey, how sick are you to skip fishing?

435
28:13.526 --> 28:14.652
Are you faking it?

436
28:14.777 --> 28:16.362
No, I'm not.

437
28:16.487 --> 28:17.655
Hey.

438
28:18.280 --> 28:20.282
Did Yeong-do fight with his ex-wife?

439
28:20.408 --> 28:22.701
Wow, my baby is so perceptive.

440
28:22.827 --> 28:24.870
I'll bring you some good food later.

441
28:24.995 --> 28:26.997
Don't cry about your stomachache.

442
28:27.123 --> 28:28.916
-Okay. -There you go. Good boy.

443
28:29.041 --> 28:29.917
See you.

444
28:57.153 --> 28:58.946
Who leaves early for counseling?

445
28:59.864 --> 29:01.490
Mom put you up to this again?

446
29:02.908 --> 29:04.910
Rehearse what we practiced earlier.

447
29:07.580 --> 29:10.916
"All my friends were doing it, so I did it for fun."

448
29:11.542 --> 29:12.960
"I didn't think much of it."

449
29:14.086 --> 29:16.881
Say exactly that in front of Mom and the counselor.

450
29:17.006 --> 29:20.050
-You promised. -You keep your promise, Dad.

451
29:20.176 --> 29:22.803
I'm really going to stay up all night and play games.

452
29:22.928 --> 29:24.638
Don't you dare nag me.

453
29:24.763 --> 29:26.098
Only for a month, though.

454
29:27.516 --> 29:30.769
Mom wouldn't get hurt even if she found out anyway.

455
29:31.687 --> 29:33.564
Do you really not know Mom?

456
29:36.734 --> 29:38.444
Your mom will die of shock.

457
29:45.910 --> 29:49.205
If she finds out you filmed that to hurt her feelings,

458
29:50.789 --> 29:52.541
she'll literally die.

459
29:54.335 --> 29:55.794
Hey, Driver.

460
29:56.545 --> 29:58.380
You must have seen it too.

461
29:58.506 --> 30:00.633
365 Days Isn't Enough.

462
30:00.758 --> 30:04.845
That was the number-one hit film on IPTV last year…

463
30:08.766 --> 30:10.059
It's you again?

464
30:11.560 --> 30:14.021
How many days has it been now?

465
30:14.146 --> 30:16.649
At the car wash, and as a designated driver…

466
30:16.774 --> 30:18.734
How long will you keep bothering me?

467
30:18.859 --> 30:21.570
Until you cancel Director Lee Mi-do's remaining contract.

468
30:23.864 --> 30:25.866
You're so damn persistent.

469
30:26.659 --> 30:29.286
What's your relationship with Director Lee Mi-do anyway?

470
30:30.287 --> 30:32.331
-Are you her boyfriend? -I'm a fan.

471
30:32.456 --> 30:33.457
Huh?

472
30:35.167 --> 30:36.335
I'm her number one fan.

473
30:42.466 --> 30:46.804
Damn, that's beautiful. So damn beautiful.

474
31:04.405 --> 31:06.156
Don't ever contact me again.

475
31:07.950 --> 31:09.618
That's what I came here to say.

476
31:18.419 --> 31:20.546
Medical report, photos of bruises.

477
31:20.671 --> 31:21.505
Hwa-young.

478
31:22.172 --> 31:24.925
Don't use things like that to get Namgung's sympathy.

479
31:26.468 --> 31:28.512
If you contact us one more time,

480
31:29.930 --> 31:31.473
I won't just sit back.

481
31:50.451 --> 31:51.577
Mom!

482
31:57.249 --> 31:58.375
Namgung.

483
31:59.043 --> 32:01.670
That day, I met the seven-year-old you again.

484
32:02.796 --> 32:06.050
The seven-year-old you that I couldn't protect.

485
32:20.189 --> 32:21.023
COURT

486
32:21.148 --> 32:22.274
I will read the verdict.

487
32:22.399 --> 32:25.361
As there is no proof that the defendant, Line Intercontinental,

488
32:25.486 --> 32:28.113
intentionally disregarded

489
32:28.238 --> 32:30.908
the damage to the component,

490
32:31.033 --> 32:33.202
and as it is difficult to conclude

491
32:33.327 --> 32:36.121
that the component caused the vehicle defect,

492
32:36.246 --> 32:38.832
causality cannot be established.

493
32:38.957 --> 32:42.753
Therefore, all of the plaintiff's claims are dismissed.

494
32:47.549 --> 32:50.511
Chairman Ko of Jisang did this, didn't he?

495
32:50.636 --> 32:53.597
His temper is really something.

496
32:53.722 --> 32:56.558
Fifty billion won's worth of land is about to vanish.

497
32:57.810 --> 33:00.104
A busted forehead means he's being nice.

498
33:02.398 --> 33:03.607
Was it Kim Jeong-hwan?

499
33:04.400 --> 33:06.110
The whistleblower from Line.

500
33:07.820 --> 33:09.321
We're looking for him.

501
33:10.030 --> 33:12.616
There's no departure record, so he should still be in the country.

502
33:14.493 --> 33:16.829
We won the trial,

503
33:16.954 --> 33:20.082
but if this guy happens to show up,

504
33:20.207 --> 33:21.667
we're in trouble.

505
33:23.043 --> 33:26.255
All of Jisang's internal verification reports have been destroyed,

506
33:26.380 --> 33:28.090
and the three researchers who testified

507
33:28.966 --> 33:30.843
were all sent overseas.

508
33:31.802 --> 33:34.221
The audit logs, transaction history,

509
33:34.346 --> 33:37.516
and raw packet records were deleted and reformatted,

510
33:38.892 --> 33:40.060
so there's no need to worry.

511
33:40.185 --> 33:42.688
Just to be safe, find him as soon as possible.

512
33:42.813 --> 33:44.189
Understood.

513
33:52.406 --> 33:54.241
She's so hard to read.

514
33:55.325 --> 33:57.619
She begged to be back in the director's chair,

515
33:58.704 --> 33:59.830
and now she refuses?

516
33:59.955 --> 34:02.374
I know. Now she's refusing.

517
34:03.041 --> 34:04.460
Why are you so calm?

518
34:06.545 --> 34:08.422
If the truth about my dad gets out,

519
34:08.547 --> 34:10.340
don't you know it would affect Ju-hyeok?

520
34:11.216 --> 34:12.718
Then we'll kill her.

521
34:13.343 --> 34:15.471
Isn't that the best way to shut her up?

522
34:15.596 --> 34:17.055
Are you crazy?

523
34:18.724 --> 34:20.434
Are you out of your mind?

524
34:22.853 --> 34:23.771
Exactly.

525
34:25.272 --> 34:26.774
That's how you're supposed to react.

526
34:36.867 --> 34:37.951
Director Lee Mi-do.

527
34:39.161 --> 34:40.871
Director Lee Mi-do just walked by.

528
34:41.872 --> 34:43.123
Did you see her?

529
34:52.090 --> 34:54.802
A master in Hadong cultivated this ujeon tea.

530
34:55.803 --> 34:59.681
You mean the foreigner we saw at the tea plantation last time?

531
34:59.807 --> 35:00.891
That's right.

532
35:01.016 --> 35:04.394
He's one of the few certified tea masters in the UK.

533
35:05.020 --> 35:08.565
He's a very important person who gets invited to British royal events.

534
35:09.107 --> 35:10.400
For the past two years,

535
35:10.526 --> 35:12.986
he's been handling the tea leaves

536
35:13.111 --> 35:15.405
from cupping to fermentation.

537
35:16.281 --> 35:18.909
-No wonder. -So the entire hectare of land we saw

538
35:19.034 --> 35:20.452
belongs to you?

539
35:21.745 --> 35:24.206
It's been in my family since my grandfather.

540
35:25.457 --> 35:28.836
This is my first business venture, so I'm quite worried.

541
35:28.961 --> 35:31.171
Wow, that's so cool!

542
35:31.296 --> 35:32.923
No wonder you look so elegant.

543
35:33.048 --> 35:35.509
You have a certain presence. Don't we all agree?

544
35:38.679 --> 35:40.264
Can I get a taste too?

545
35:43.767 --> 35:47.187
Oh my, what brings a young man like you to this place?

546
35:47.312 --> 35:48.355
He's handsome.

547
35:48.480 --> 35:50.232
I'm very interested in tea.

548
36:14.006 --> 36:15.757
The aftertaste is a bit bitter.

549
36:17.759 --> 36:19.720
That's how ujeon tea is.

550
36:19.845 --> 36:21.680
It's made from young leaves,

551
36:21.805 --> 36:23.265
so the scent is light,

552
36:23.390 --> 36:25.142
but it leaves a slight bitterness.

553
36:25.267 --> 36:26.894
That's the charm of ujeon tea.

554
36:27.686 --> 36:29.062
No.

555
36:29.187 --> 36:31.356
It's because you mixed in cheap powdered sejak tea.

556
36:35.694 --> 36:38.530
You were probably offered investments with guaranteed principal.

557
36:39.615 --> 36:41.241
She promised upfront profits

558
36:41.366 --> 36:44.244
and guaranteed dividends so you wouldn't lose money.

559
36:46.038 --> 36:47.164
But you know what?

560
36:47.289 --> 36:48.248
It's a scam.

561
36:48.999 --> 36:49.875
-What? -What?

562
36:51.460 --> 36:52.586
Despite her appearance,

563
36:52.711 --> 36:54.796
she has five fraud convictions.

564
36:54.922 --> 36:57.132
-Oh my. -No way.

565
36:59.134 --> 37:01.386
We all have other plans, right?

566
37:01.511 --> 37:03.305
-Yes, we do. -Oh my goodness.

567
37:09.895 --> 37:11.396
I'll call you later.

568
37:18.612 --> 37:20.572
You're still looking beautiful, Mom.

569
37:23.241 --> 37:24.242
How have you been?

570
37:37.589 --> 37:38.757
What brings you here?

571
37:40.258 --> 37:43.011
You acted like you'd kill me if I ever called you.

572
37:43.136 --> 37:45.806
You know why. It's about Mi-do.

573
37:47.391 --> 37:48.809
I didn't ask her for it.

574
37:49.685 --> 37:51.728
She pitied me and helped me out.

575
37:55.482 --> 37:56.984
That's ridiculous.

576
37:57.109 --> 37:59.111
Like Mi-do would ever do that.

577
37:59.236 --> 38:00.779
So what?

578
38:00.904 --> 38:04.116
You've come to confront me over some cash from your girl?

579
38:05.575 --> 38:06.827
Confront?

580
38:08.996 --> 38:10.622
That's a cute way to put it.

581
38:19.089 --> 38:22.759
Singapore DBJ Private Banking, Catherine Tak.

582
38:25.387 --> 38:26.304
That's you, right?

583
38:32.644 --> 38:36.273
Since you have no assets in your name, it took me a while to find out.

584
38:37.816 --> 38:39.776
I submitted proof to the court

585
38:39.901 --> 38:42.571
that you used Catherine Tak as your alias for the account.

586
38:43.739 --> 38:45.240
By now,

587
38:45.365 --> 38:46.992
it's probably been frozen.

588
38:49.286 --> 38:51.079
I also got the deposit for this place

589
38:51.621 --> 38:54.916
and the one for the leased land in Hadong provisionally attached,

590
38:55.042 --> 38:56.001
so just know that.

591
38:59.755 --> 39:00.589
Son.

592
39:02.049 --> 39:06.386
Korean law doesn't recognize debt between parents and children.

593
39:06.511 --> 39:07.971
We're bound by blood.

594
39:08.096 --> 39:10.307
The law can't do anything about it.

595
39:11.141 --> 39:12.601
Don't you know that by now?

596
39:12.726 --> 39:14.061
Of course I know.

597
39:16.730 --> 39:17.939
That damn law.

598
39:19.066 --> 39:20.901
That damn blood tie.

599
39:22.652 --> 39:23.487
So…

600
39:25.530 --> 39:27.908
I'll use that blood tie to play God.

601
39:31.495 --> 39:32.913
Emotional instability,

602
39:33.830 --> 39:35.373
impaired judgment,

603
39:37.209 --> 39:40.337
delusional disorder, and nervous breakdown.

604
39:43.048 --> 39:43.924
How's that?

605
39:45.425 --> 39:47.969
They're reasons to have you committed. Do you like them?

606
39:49.638 --> 39:52.182
Because I'm your only legal guardian.

607
39:52.766 --> 39:54.142
Which means,

608
39:54.267 --> 39:57.979
I can lock you up in a psych ward whenever I want.

609
39:59.481 --> 40:00.857
Are you crazy?

610
40:00.982 --> 40:02.526
Have you lost your mind?

611
40:03.151 --> 40:04.194
Mom.

612
40:05.487 --> 40:07.906
You shouldn't have messed with Mi-do.

613
40:11.493 --> 40:13.954
You shouldn't have messed with Mi-do.

614
40:27.175 --> 40:28.802
Detectives will be here soon.

615
40:31.138 --> 40:33.306
I have one last favor to ask.

616
40:35.767 --> 40:37.435
Don't make this any uglier.

617
40:40.063 --> 40:41.565
You can at least do that.

618
41:06.131 --> 41:07.757
Who are you to ruin this?

619
41:08.884 --> 41:10.719
I've planned this for years!

620
41:10.844 --> 41:12.804
Who do you think you are?

621
41:15.557 --> 41:17.350
You're marrying Mi-do soon, right?

622
41:17.934 --> 41:19.269
Does she know?

623
41:19.394 --> 41:21.188
About my private loans?

624
41:21.313 --> 41:22.439
It's probably…

625
41:24.191 --> 41:25.400
over 300 million won.

626
41:27.861 --> 41:29.196
You know how it is.

627
41:29.321 --> 41:31.781
They don't care about renouncing inheritance or the law.

628
41:31.907 --> 41:33.909
They'll tear you apart to get paid.

629
41:34.034 --> 41:36.661
Still, rather than paying it back by yourself,

630
41:36.786 --> 41:39.080
it'd be better to pay it back together with Mi-do.

631
41:39.206 --> 41:40.332
Shut your mouth!

632
41:40.457 --> 41:42.125
Is Mi-do still filming?

633
41:42.709 --> 41:43.960
When does it come out?

634
41:44.085 --> 41:46.338
I'll do an interview from prison.

635
41:46.463 --> 41:47.714
Or maybe not?

636
41:50.008 --> 41:51.551
If Mi-do makes it big,

637
41:51.676 --> 41:53.178
would that be better for me?

638
41:53.303 --> 41:55.305
I'll have to think about it.

639
41:57.182 --> 41:58.975
You think I'll go down alone?

640
42:00.227 --> 42:02.145
-I'll drag Mi-do into it. -Stop it.

641
42:02.270 --> 42:03.980
She sent me money for two years.

642
42:04.105 --> 42:08.276
I'll go to the police and tell them she's an accomplice.

643
42:08.818 --> 42:10.695
I'm never going down alone.

644
42:15.742 --> 42:16.660
Hey!

645
42:20.580 --> 42:22.332
Let go of my mom!

646
42:24.751 --> 42:28.421
YEONMUHEON

647
42:28.546 --> 42:29.798
Let go of my mom right now!

648
42:29.923 --> 42:31.341
Let go!

649
42:48.942 --> 42:49.901
Get up.

650
42:50.026 --> 42:53.571
-Where's the money? -I don't have it!

651
42:53.697 --> 42:55.448
-Give it! -I don't have it!

652
42:56.116 --> 42:57.742
-Who the hell are you? -My son.

653
42:58.910 --> 42:59.869
You crazy bastard!

654
43:13.758 --> 43:15.302
Damn it.

655
43:15.427 --> 43:17.887
Get out of my way, you fucker!

656
43:18.013 --> 43:20.223
Come here! Come here!

657
43:21.141 --> 43:22.392
Damn it!

658
43:22.517 --> 43:23.351
Ugh, seriously.

659
43:23.476 --> 43:25.270
You crazy bastard.

660
43:25.395 --> 43:26.938
Where did this bitch go?

661
43:27.605 --> 43:28.606
Ugh, fuck.

662
43:28.732 --> 43:30.608
Let go! Let me go.

663
43:30.734 --> 43:35.488
You posted used phones, took the cash, and ghosted 12 times. Is that true?

664
43:40.327 --> 43:41.661
It's all my fault.

665
43:43.455 --> 43:45.081
He studies art.

666
43:45.707 --> 43:47.542
But I don't have the means,

667
43:48.168 --> 43:50.378
so I couldn't even send him to classes.

668
43:52.464 --> 43:55.216
But since he's a minor, he'll be released soon, right?

669
44:01.473 --> 44:02.307
Oh, dear.

670
44:07.103 --> 44:10.523
Thought you hooked a rich guy and were paying the interest.

671
44:10.648 --> 44:12.067
What's all this?

672
44:13.360 --> 44:15.528
My husband's life insurance payout is coming.

673
44:15.653 --> 44:16.905
I'll pay you then.

674
44:17.030 --> 44:20.200
That's barely anything, isn't it?

675
44:21.284 --> 44:23.036
How will you pay me back?

676
44:23.161 --> 44:24.704
-Huh? -Let go of my mom!

677
45:01.574 --> 45:04.452
Meet me at the 24-Hour Mediterranean Sauna by 4:00.

678
45:05.412 --> 45:07.622
A large top and size 32 bottoms.

679
45:08.581 --> 45:11.543
A casual look that's simple but still dapper.

680
45:13.086 --> 45:16.047
Keep the top, bottom, and jacket under 100,000 won.

681
45:26.307 --> 45:27.934
It came out to 114,000 won.

682
45:28.852 --> 45:31.688
It's hard to get a full outfit for 100,000 won these days.

683
45:33.648 --> 45:36.067
I hate collars like this. They're uncomfortable.

684
45:39.904 --> 45:41.698
You knew?

685
45:41.823 --> 45:43.116
Not from the start.

686
45:44.325 --> 45:45.743
I caught a glimpse earlier.

687
45:46.995 --> 45:48.746
You were behind the inflatable tube man.

688
45:52.834 --> 45:54.794
I didn't do it on purpose.

689
45:54.919 --> 45:57.172
You suddenly took the day off.

690
45:58.089 --> 46:00.717
And you suddenly went to the Cheonan factory last time.

691
46:03.803 --> 46:06.222
Of course, you made your intentions clear.

692
46:06.347 --> 46:09.601
But I was worried you'd get all righteous and do something on your own.

693
46:09.726 --> 46:11.269
That would be dangerous, so…

694
46:11.394 --> 46:13.021
So you followed me from home?

695
46:14.814 --> 46:16.024
I'm sorry.

696
46:19.652 --> 46:21.654
Whatever. Keep the change.

697
46:24.199 --> 46:25.617
Let me buy you a meal.

698
46:28.161 --> 46:30.246
The pork cutlet here is really good.

699
46:31.122 --> 46:34.167
I went to middle and high school here, so I know.

700
46:34.292 --> 46:36.002
It's really good. I'll pay.

701
46:38.630 --> 46:39.464
Deok-sun.

702
46:41.007 --> 46:43.676
Do I look like I'm in the mood for pork cutlets?

703
46:44.511 --> 46:45.929
You saw everything earlier.

704
46:48.973 --> 46:50.391
Maybe some sikhye instead.

705
46:50.975 --> 46:52.810
Buy me sikhye. I'm craving it.

706
46:59.275 --> 47:02.695
HOT CHOCOLATE CHIPS

707
47:04.572 --> 47:05.740
-Sikhye. -And some eggs?

708
47:05.865 --> 47:06.699
I'll have ramen.

709
47:08.243 --> 47:09.327
Park Su-a?

710
47:10.954 --> 47:13.122
It's been a while. How have you been?

711
47:13.248 --> 47:15.041
Oh, it's been a while.

712
47:15.166 --> 47:17.335
Hey, let's keep in touch.

713
47:17.460 --> 47:19.295
I heard you're at Hunmin.

714
47:19.420 --> 47:21.589
-I'm at Mugang Planning. -I'm at Jaeu Insurance.

715
47:21.714 --> 47:24.050
We work close by. How have we never seen each other?

716
47:24.175 --> 47:25.051
I know, right?

717
47:25.802 --> 47:27.178
When you have time,

718
47:28.137 --> 47:29.764
let's grab lunch.

719
47:31.349 --> 47:32.642
-Oh… -Park Su-a.

720
47:36.771 --> 47:37.814
I'm her cousin.

721
47:38.690 --> 47:41.109
-Oh, hello. -Hello.

722
47:41.818 --> 47:43.194
You coming?

723
47:43.319 --> 47:45.113
Oh, right. Coming.

724
47:45.238 --> 47:46.072
I should go.

725
47:46.197 --> 47:47.115
-Okay. -Bye.

726
47:50.910 --> 47:52.120
That was them, right?

727
47:53.329 --> 47:56.040
The ones who stole your gym clothes and kept your textbooks.

728
47:58.084 --> 47:59.085
How did you know?

729
47:59.627 --> 48:00.628
Your face gave it away.

730
48:01.713 --> 48:04.007
Why even respond to them? Just ignore them.

731
48:08.553 --> 48:11.055
But usually, in a situation like this,

732
48:11.180 --> 48:13.266
wouldn't you speak up for me?

733
48:13.975 --> 48:15.935
Stop reading comic books.

734
48:16.060 --> 48:19.314
Me fighting young girls would just be weird and pathetic.

735
48:19.897 --> 48:21.107
Yeah, yeah.

736
48:24.485 --> 48:25.862
Next time that happens,

737
48:25.987 --> 48:27.697
just repeat these three phrases.

738
48:28.865 --> 48:29.741
"Why would I?"

739
48:30.658 --> 48:31.576
"So what?"

740
48:32.243 --> 48:33.161
"Who cares?"

741
48:33.786 --> 48:34.829
Got it?

742
48:39.083 --> 48:40.001
Forget it.

743
48:40.126 --> 48:41.794
I won't see them again anyway.

744
48:42.670 --> 48:44.422
Besides, it's all in the past.

745
48:48.551 --> 48:49.844
Back in high school,

746
48:49.969 --> 48:52.764
I couldn't go to the cafeteria for three years.

747
48:52.889 --> 48:54.390
What did they say again?

748
48:54.515 --> 48:56.643
They said I might have AIDS or something.

749
48:57.226 --> 48:58.686
They made such a huge fuss.

750
48:58.811 --> 49:00.688
So I couldn't eat a proper meal

751
49:00.813 --> 49:02.440
and lived on bread and snacks.

752
49:02.565 --> 49:04.275
That's how I got by.

753
49:07.654 --> 49:09.781
That's when I started liking snacks.

754
49:10.448 --> 49:12.200
And that's also why I joined Hunmin.

755
49:12.992 --> 49:14.786
-Why tell me this now? -What?

756
49:16.913 --> 49:17.955
Where are you going?

757
49:21.167 --> 49:22.752
Oh, I'm sorry!

758
49:22.877 --> 49:24.379
-Are you okay? -Yes, are you?

759
49:24.504 --> 49:25.380
Darn it.

760
49:26.089 --> 49:27.465
I'm so sorry.

761
49:28.883 --> 49:31.511
Park Su-a still gives zero reaction.

762
49:31.636 --> 49:33.054
It's no fun teasing her.

763
49:33.179 --> 49:34.013
I know, right?

764
49:34.138 --> 49:35.473
Ji Su-yeon was fun.

765
49:35.598 --> 49:37.767
Yeah, Ji Su-yeon was hilarious. The…

766
49:50.780 --> 49:52.115
Mugang Planning.

767
49:52.240 --> 49:53.282
Jaeu Insurance.

768
49:54.575 --> 49:56.119
-And you? -Oh, me?

769
49:56.244 --> 49:57.662
BQ Construction.

770
49:57.787 --> 49:59.247
BQ.

771
49:59.372 --> 50:01.207
Close to Hunmin Confectionery.

772
50:01.332 --> 50:03.418
Yes, but why…

773
50:05.503 --> 50:06.587
From now on,

774
50:06.713 --> 50:10.091
if you ever come across Park Su-a, don't you dare talk to her. Just walk by.

775
50:12.635 --> 50:15.304
Don't pretend to be friendly just to insult her.

776
50:17.098 --> 50:18.641
What do you mean?

777
50:18.766 --> 50:20.893
You can't do this, even as her cousin.

778
50:21.018 --> 50:24.605
Did Park Su-a say that we bullied her?

779
50:25.314 --> 50:27.400
We never did anything like that.

780
50:27.525 --> 50:28.776
You never did?

781
50:29.986 --> 50:30.862
Hey.

782
50:31.446 --> 50:33.030
I asked if you never did.

783
50:34.490 --> 50:35.825
I'm warning you.

784
50:36.617 --> 50:40.371
If you ever run into Park Su-a on the street and speak to her,

785
50:41.789 --> 50:42.999
all three of you

786
50:44.083 --> 50:45.626
will seriously pay for it.

787
50:48.463 --> 50:49.464
Mr. Namgung…

788
50:50.798 --> 50:51.632
Ho!

789
50:55.178 --> 50:56.512
Stop it. Let's go.

790
50:56.637 --> 50:58.055
You've been warned.

791
50:58.181 --> 50:59.474
Don't talk to her.

792
51:01.684 --> 51:04.187
Wow, this is unbelievable.

793
51:04.979 --> 51:07.315
Hey, Park Su-a, you should apologize to us.

794
51:10.234 --> 51:11.402
Why would I?

795
51:13.029 --> 51:15.531
Did you not hear what your cousin just said?

796
51:15.656 --> 51:17.283
He completely insulted us.

797
51:17.408 --> 51:18.242
So what?

798
51:18.367 --> 51:20.912
He really spooked us. Do you have any idea?

799
51:21.037 --> 51:22.371
Who cares?

800
51:31.172 --> 51:32.507
Let's go.

801
51:40.389 --> 51:42.183
Yeah, I'm chopping them now.

802
51:42.975 --> 51:45.144
So I put them in all at once?

803
51:45.686 --> 51:48.147
The onions, carrots… And potatoes?

804
51:48.272 --> 51:49.524
Oh, okay.

805
51:49.649 --> 51:50.858
And green onions?

806
51:50.983 --> 51:51.818
Oh, and…

807
51:53.402 --> 51:54.779
I'll call you back.

808
51:56.572 --> 51:58.115
Hey, Director Lee!

809
51:58.241 --> 51:59.283
Open the door.

810
51:59.951 --> 52:01.452
Open up!

811
52:02.829 --> 52:05.790
Open the door! Open up!

812
52:05.915 --> 52:08.084
Open the door!

813
52:20.346 --> 52:22.765
Ms. Song, what are you doing?

814
52:22.890 --> 52:25.351
Why aren't you coming back?

815
52:26.435 --> 52:28.938
Are you trying to torture me to death?

816
52:29.063 --> 52:32.233
If you keep bothering me, I just might.

817
52:33.276 --> 52:34.193
I knew it.

818
52:35.486 --> 52:36.779
I figured as much.

819
52:37.947 --> 52:39.490
You're getting revenge on me.

820
52:44.287 --> 52:46.664
I was out of my mind back then.

821
52:46.789 --> 52:49.333
I'll keep your secret, Ms. Song.

822
52:49.458 --> 52:50.793
So don't worry and leave.

823
52:53.379 --> 52:54.964
Suddenly acting all nice.

824
52:56.257 --> 52:58.342
Just tell me to get on my knees.

825
52:58.467 --> 53:00.386
No, you don't need to.

826
53:00.511 --> 53:02.763
I don't want to see you anymore. Just go.

827
53:02.889 --> 53:04.307
What do you want?

828
53:04.432 --> 53:05.266
Is it money?

829
53:05.933 --> 53:08.477
Just say so. Stop pretending to be nice!

830
53:17.236 --> 53:18.404
Hey!

831
53:31.250 --> 53:35.129
If you ever come back here again, I won't let you get away with it.

832
53:35.254 --> 53:36.881
This is your last warning.

833
53:48.142 --> 53:50.519
Ugh, Song Hae-na, seriously.

834
53:52.688 --> 53:54.440
Is she trying to test me or…

835
53:55.816 --> 53:58.778
Song Hae-na is here, right?

836
54:32.603 --> 54:34.188
Song Hae-na isn't here.

837
54:34.772 --> 54:37.483
She just left. You can catch her if you go now.

838
54:37.608 --> 54:40.069
I only believe things I see with my own eyes.

839
54:45.866 --> 54:46.701
By the way…

840
54:49.620 --> 54:50.830
why the sudden formal tone?

841
54:52.999 --> 54:55.376
I no longer hold the upper hand.

842
54:55.501 --> 54:57.003
Go tell Song Hae-na

843
54:57.628 --> 55:00.006
that I will never breathe a word about it.

844
55:01.007 --> 55:03.259
I'm blocking her number now,

845
55:03.384 --> 55:05.386
so tell her not to try calling.

846
55:06.512 --> 55:08.264
Did you block my number too?

847
55:13.102 --> 55:14.186
No wonder.

848
55:15.312 --> 55:17.565
I couldn't get through to you.

849
55:18.816 --> 55:20.818
I thought about using another phone,

850
55:20.943 --> 55:22.945
but my pride wouldn't let me.

851
55:25.031 --> 55:26.073
Still…

852
55:32.413 --> 55:33.706
I lost again.

853
55:38.753 --> 55:41.422
Do you think I came here to catch Song Hae-na?

854
55:42.506 --> 55:43.799
I'm not an idiot.

855
56:05.404 --> 56:06.405
It was so annoying.

856
56:08.616 --> 56:10.201
I kept thinking about it.

857
56:15.456 --> 56:17.166
So I came to check.

858
56:19.126 --> 56:21.295
If I just lost my mind that night,

859
56:22.004 --> 56:24.298
or if I'm still out of my mind.

860
56:30.471 --> 56:33.891
Besides the deleted scenes you want to hide from others,

861
56:34.600 --> 56:36.560
there are other hidden scenes.

862
56:37.311 --> 56:39.522
The ones that even I want to forget.

863
56:39.647 --> 56:41.690
The ones I want to tear to pieces.

864
56:42.858 --> 56:44.777
The ones I want to keep hidden.

865
56:44.902 --> 56:46.570
The ones they must never know about.

866
56:46.695 --> 56:48.030
Those kinds of untold stories.

867
57:19.145 --> 57:22.773
I can't help but think you're hiding something.

868
57:25.484 --> 57:28.487
What is it that makes you refuse to return as a director

869
57:30.447 --> 57:32.074
and put me through such hell?

870
57:38.205 --> 57:39.790
You don't want to direct, do you?

871
57:41.667 --> 57:43.335
You're scared, aren't you?

872
57:53.137 --> 57:54.889
I knew it. You're scared.

873
57:57.600 --> 57:58.684
No, I'm not.

874
58:00.352 --> 58:01.729
That's not it.

875
58:03.022 --> 58:04.356
Yes, you are.

876
58:04.940 --> 58:06.150
You want to run away.

877
58:07.109 --> 58:08.903
You're scared and terrified.

878
58:10.779 --> 58:12.656
But you feel bad for your boyfriend,

879
58:12.781 --> 58:14.909
so you're too ashamed to do it.

880
58:16.619 --> 58:17.536
Am I wrong?

881
58:18.871 --> 58:19.955
You're wrong.

882
58:27.254 --> 58:28.672
Want me to help you escape?

883
58:31.300 --> 58:34.637
You were desperate enough to go beg Song Hae-na,

884
58:36.138 --> 58:38.224
but I got in the way and ruined it.

885
58:40.142 --> 58:44.230
You can say you had the talent but just got unlucky.

886
58:48.817 --> 58:51.153
You got tangled up with some crazy guy,

887
58:52.321 --> 58:54.073
and got completely screwed over.

888
58:58.202 --> 59:00.788
Burying a rookie director before they even start

889
59:00.913 --> 59:03.540
is incredibly easy for me.

890
59:09.255 --> 59:11.173
Why would you go that far for me?

891
59:14.009 --> 59:15.678
What do you want from me?

892
59:19.098 --> 59:20.641
One thing is for sure.

893
59:22.601 --> 59:24.103
It's not because of the settlement.

894
01:00:15.946 --> 01:00:17.072
Attorney Han.

895
01:00:38.719 --> 01:00:41.138
Did he leave? I thought he was here.

896
01:00:45.601 --> 01:00:46.727
Attorney Han.

897
01:00:47.895 --> 01:00:50.564
I'm calling about the report on Jisang.

898
01:00:50.689 --> 01:00:52.649
There's something you need to check.

899
01:00:52.775 --> 01:00:54.777
I'm home. Email it to me.

900
01:00:54.902 --> 01:00:56.403
I'll check and call you back.

901
01:02:02.136 --> 01:02:03.262
I…

902
01:02:03.929 --> 01:02:05.973
kissed this man.

903
01:03:11.830 --> 01:03:14.958
Mi-do cries whenever she sees me these days.

904
01:03:15.083 --> 01:03:15.918
Is she going through menopause?

905
01:03:16.043 --> 01:03:16.877
EXPAT POSITION IN PARIS

906
01:03:17.002 --> 01:03:19.171
Are you getting married, Mr. Namgung? You are, right?

907
01:03:20.422 --> 01:03:21.757
I'll let you quit directing.

908
01:03:22.299 --> 01:03:23.550
Let's have some fun for a bit.

909
01:03:23.675 --> 01:03:25.844
Did Mr. Namgung take out a private loan?

910
01:03:25.969 --> 01:03:27.971
I already died when I was seven,

911
01:03:28.096 --> 01:03:30.057
so I'm living on borrowed time.

912
01:03:30.182 --> 01:03:31.350
Mess with me and see.

913
01:03:31.475 --> 01:03:33.936
I'll show you how crazy I can get.

914
01:03:34.645 --> 01:03:36.605
Subtitle translation by Soya Back
